msgid "Your names"
msgstr "Softastur"

#, kde-format
msgctxt "EMAIL OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your emails"
msgstr "alministradores@softastur.org"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:40
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title title of the dialog"
msgid "About Bug Reporting - Help"
msgstr "Tocante al informe de fallos - Ayuda"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:52
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Information about bug reporting"
msgstr "Información tocante al informe de fallos"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:54
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid "You can help us improve this software by filing a bug report."
msgstr ""
"Pues ayudamos a ameyorar esti software rellenando un informe de fallos."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:55
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"<note>It is safe to close this dialog. If you do not want to, you do not "
"have to file a bug report.</note>"
msgstr ""
"<note>Ye seguro zarrar esti diálogu. Si nun quies, nun tienes d'unviar un "
"informe de fallos.</note>"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:57
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"In order to generate a useful bug report we need some information about both "
"the crash and your system. (You may also need to install some debug "
"packages.)"
msgstr ""
"Pa xenerar un informe de fallos útil necesitamos della información tocante "
"al casque y el to sistema. (Quiciabes precises instalar dellos paquetes de "
"depuración.)"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:62
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Bug Reporting Assistant Guide"
msgstr "Guía del asistente d'informar fallos"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:64
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"This assistant will guide you through the crash reporting process for the "
"KDE bug tracking system. All the information you enter on the bug report "
"<strong>must be written in English</strong>, if possible, as KDE is formed "
"internationally."
msgstr ""
"Esti asistente empobinaráte pente'l procesu d'informe de casques pal sistema "
"de rastrexu de fallos de KDE. Si ye posible, tola información qu'introduzas "
"nel informe de fallos <strong>tien de tar escrita n'inglés</strong> darréu "
"que KDE ye un proyeutu internacional."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:71 aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:174
#: bugzillaintegration/reportassistantdialog.cpp:83
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "What do you know about the crash?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes tocante al casque?"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:74
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"In this page you need to describe how much do you know about the desktop and "
"the application state before it crashed."
msgstr ""
"Nesta páxina precises describir cuanto sabes tocante al estáu del escritoriu "
"y aplicación enantes que cascara."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:76
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"If you can, describe in as much detail as possible the crash circumstances, "
"and what you were doing when the application crashed (this information is "
"going to be requested later.) You can mention: "
msgstr ""
"Si pues, describi col mayor detalle posible les circunstancias del casque y "
"qué tabes faciendo cuando l'aplicación cascó (va solicitase esta información "
"sero). Pues mentar: "

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:79
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich crash situation example"
msgid "actions you were taking inside or outside the application"
msgstr "aiciones que tubieres faciendo dientro o fuera de l'aplicación"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:81
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich crash situation example"
msgid ""
"documents or images that you were using and their type/format (later if you "
"go to look at the report in the bug tracking system, you can attach a file "
"to the report)"
msgstr ""
"documentos o imáxenes que tubieres usando y la so triba/formatu (sero si vas "
"mirar l'informe nel sistema de restrexu de fallos, pues axuntar un ficheru "
"al informe)"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:84
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich crash situation example"
msgid "widgets that you were running"
msgstr "widgets que tubieres executando"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:85
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich crash situation example"
msgid "the URL of a web site you were browsing"
msgstr "la URL del sitiu web que tubieres restolando"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:86
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich crash situation example"
msgid "configuration details of the application"
msgstr "detalles de configuración de l'aplicación"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:87
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich crash situation example"
msgid "or other strange things you notice before or after the crash. "
msgstr ""
"u otres coses estrañes de les que te decatares enantes o dempués del casque."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:89
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"Screenshots can be very helpful sometimes. You can attach them to the bug "
"report after it is posted to the bug tracking system."
msgstr ""
"A vegaes les captures de pantalla puen ser perútiles. Pues axuntales al "
"informe de fallos dempués d'espublizalu nel sistema de rastrexu de fallos."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:94
#, fuzzy, kde-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Crash Information (backtrace)"
msgstr "Información del fallu (traza inversa)"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:96
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"This page will generate a \"backtrace\" of the crash. This is information "
"that tells the developers where the application crashed."
msgstr ""
"Esta páxina va xenerar una «traza inversa» del error. Esta información "
"indica a los desendolcadores por qué falló l'aplicación."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:99
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"If the crash information is not detailed enough, you may need to install "
"some debug packages and reload it (if the <interface>Install Debug Symbols</"
"interface> button is available you can use it to automatically install the "
"missing information.)"
msgstr ""
"Si la información del casque nun ta detallada abondo, quiciabes precises "
"instalar dellos paquetes de depuración y recargala (si ta disponible'l botón "
"d'<interface>Instalar símbolos de depuración</interface>, pues usalu pa "
"instalar automáticamente la información faltante)."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:103
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"You can find more information about backtraces, what they mean, and how they "
"are useful at <link>%1</link>"
msgstr ""
"Pues consultar más información sobre les trazas inverses, qué son y por qué "
"resulten útiles en <link>%1</link>"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:105
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"Once you get a useful backtrace (or if you do not want to install the "
"missing debugging packages) you can continue."
msgstr ""
"Una vegada que tengas una traza inversa útil (o si nun quies instalar los "
"paquetes de símbolos de depuración faltantes) pues siguir."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:110
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Conclusions"
msgstr "Conclusiones"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:112
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"Using the quality of the crash information gathered, and your answers on the "
"previous page, the assistant will tell you if the crash is worth reporting "
"or not."
msgstr ""
"Usando la calidá de la información del casque axuntada y les tos rempuestes "
"na páxina anterior, l'asistente diráte si'l casque paga la pena informalu o "
"non."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:115
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"If the crash is worth reporting but the application is not supported in the "
"KDE bug tracking system, you will need to directly contact the maintainer of "
"the application."
msgstr ""
"Si paga la pena d'informar l'informe pero l'aplicación nun ta sofitada nel "
"sistema de rastrexu de fallos de KDE, precisarás contautar direutamente col "
"caltenedor de l'aplicación."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:118
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"If the crash is listed as being not worth reporting, and you think the "
"assistant has made a mistake, you can still manually report the bug by "
"logging into the bug tracking system. You can also go back and change "
"information and download debug packages."
msgstr ""
"Si'l fallu nun merez reportase y pienses que l'asistente tien un fallu, entá "
"pues reportar el fallu manualmente aniciando sesión nel sitiu "
"d'alministración de fallos usando un restolador web. Tamién pues volver "
"atrás pa camudar la información y/o obtener los paquetes de símbolos de "
"depuración faltantes."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:126
#, fuzzy, kde-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Login into the bug tracking system"
msgstr "Aniciar sesión nel sistema de seguimientu de fallos"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:128
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"We may need to contact you in the future to ask for further information. As "
"we need to keep track of the bug reports, you need to have an account on the "
"KDE bug tracking system. If you do not have one, you can create one here: "
"<link>%1</link>"
msgstr ""
"Podemos precisar contautar contigo nel futuru pa solicitar más información. "
"Darréu que tenemos que tener un rexistru de los informes de fallos, tienes "
"de tener una cuenta nel sitiu d'alministración de fallos. Si nun tienes una, "
"puedes facela equí: <link>%1</link>"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:134
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"Then, enter your username and password and press the Login button. You can "
"use this login to directly access the KDE bug tracking system later."
msgstr ""
"Dempués, ingresa'l to nome d'usuariu y contraseña y calca nel botón Aniciar "
"sesión. D'esta miente, vas poder acceder direutamente al sitiu "
"d'alministración de fallos de KDE."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:137
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"The KWallet dialog may appear when pressing Login to save your password in "
"the KWallet password system. Also, it will prompt you for the KWallet "
"password upon loading to autocomplete the login fields if you use this "
"assistant again."
msgstr ""
"El diálogu del sistema de carteres de KDE «KWallet» pue apaecer al calcar "
"Aniciar sesión p'almacenar la contraseña. Tamién, pue requerir la contraseña "
"de la cartera de KDE al entamar pa auto completar los campos d'usuariu y "
"contraseña si uses esti asistente nuevamente."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:144
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "List of possible duplicate reports"
msgstr "Llistáu de posibles informes duplicaos"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:147
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
#| msgctxt "@info/rich"
#| msgid ""
#| "This page will search the bug report database for similar crashes which "
#| "are possible duplicates of your bug. If there are similar bug reports "
#| "found, you can double click on them to see details. Then, read the "
#| "current bug report information so you can check to see if they are "
#| "similar. "
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"This page will search the bug report system for similar crashes which are "
"possible duplicates of your bug. If there are similar bug reports found, you "
"can double click on them to see details. Then, read the current bug report "
"information so you can check to see if they are similar. "
msgstr ""
"Esta páxina va guetar pente la base de datos d'informe de fallos por fallos "
"asemeyaos que podríen duplicases del fallu qu'acabes d'esperimentar. Si "
"s'alcuentren informes de fallu asemeyaos, pues facer duble clic nún d'ellos "
"pa ver los detalles. Postreramente, llei la información del informe de fallu "
"actual pa poder comparalos. "

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:152
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"If you are very sure your bug is the same as another that is previously "
"reported, you can set your information to be attached to the existing report."
msgstr ""
"Si tas seguru dafechu, de que'l fallu ye'l mesmu qu'otru yá reportáu "
"anteriormente, pues axuntar la información al informe yá esistente."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:155
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"If you are unsure whether your report is the same, follow the main options "
"to tentatively mark your crash as a duplicate of that report. This is "
"usually the safest thing to do. We cannot uncombine bug reports, but we can "
"easily merge them."
msgstr ""
"Si nun tás seguru de que'l fallu seya'l mesmu pues usar la opción principal "
"de manera tentativa pa marcar el fallu como duplicáu d'esti informe. "
"Usualmente esto ye'l pasu más seguru. Nun podemos separtar la información "
"que s'alcuentra nun mesmu informe de fallu, pero podemos cenciellamente "
"xunir dos informes de fallu estremaos."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:159
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"If not enough possible duplicates are found, or you did not find a similar "
"report, then you can force it to search for more bug reports (only if the "
"date range limit is not reached.)"
msgstr ""
"Si nun s'atoparon suficientes posibles duplicaos, o nun s'alcontró un "
"informe asemeyáu, pues forciar la gueta de más informes de fallu (sólo si "
"nun se sobrepasó'l rangu de feches)."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:162
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"If you do not find any related reports, your crash information is not useful "
"enough, and you really cannot give additional information about the crash "
"context, then it is better to not file the bug report, thereby closing the "
"assistant."
msgstr ""
"Si nun alcuentres dengún informe rellacionáu, la to información de fallu nun "
"ye lo bastante útil y braeramente nun pues apurrir información adicional "
"sobre'l contestu del fallu, ye meyor que nun unvies l'informe de fallu, "
"asina que pues zarrar l'asistente."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:169
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Details of the bug report and your system"
msgstr "Detalles del informe de fallu y del to sistema"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:171
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"In this case you need to write a title and description of the crash. Explain "
"as best you can. "
msgstr ""
"Nesti casu tienes d'escribir un títulu y una descripción pal informe de "
"fallu. Desplícalo lo meyor que puedas. "

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:175
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"You can also specify your distribution method (GNU/Linux distribution or "
"packaging system) or if you compiled the KDE Platform from sources."
msgstr ""
"Tamién pues especificar un métodu de distribución (distribución GNU/Linux o "
"sistema d'empaquetáu) o si compilesti la plataforma KDE dende les fontes."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:178
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
#| msgctxt "@info/rich"
#| msgid "<note>You should write in English.</note>"
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"<note>You should <strong>write those information in English</strong>.</note>"
msgstr "<note>Tienes d'escribir n'inglés.</note>"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:182
#: bugzillaintegration/reportassistantdialog.cpp:153
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Sending the Crash Report"
msgstr "Unviu del informe del casque"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:184
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"The last page will send the bug report to the bug tracking system and will "
"notify you when it is done. It will then show the web address of the bug "
"report in the KDE bug tracking system, so that you can look at the report "
"later."
msgstr ""
"Esta páxina va unviar l'informe de fallu al sitiu d'alministración de fallos "
"y notificarásete cuando fine. Dempués va facilitásete la direición web del "
"informe de fallos nel sitiu de KDE, pa que puedas consultar l'informe nel "
"futuru."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:188
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
#| msgctxt "@info/rich"
#| msgid ""
#| "If the process fails, you can click <interface>Retry</interface> to try "
#| "sending the bug report again. If the report cannot be sent because the "
#| "bug tracking database has a problem, you can save it to a file to "
#| "manually report later."
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"If the process fails, you can click <interface>Retry</interface> to try "
"sending the bug report again. If the report cannot be sent because the bug "
"tracking system has a problem, you can save it to a file to manually report "
"later."
msgstr ""
"Si'l procesu falla pues facer clic nel botón <interface>Retentar</interface> "
"pa volver a tentar unviar l'informe de fallu. Si l'informe nun se pue unviar "
"por un problema na base de datos del sistema d'alministración, pues guardalu "
"nun ficheru y reportalu más sero."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:194
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid "Thank you for being part of KDE!"
msgstr "¡Gracies por contribuyir con KDE!"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:195
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"If you are interested in helping us to keep the KDE bug tracker system clean "
"and useful, which allows the developers to be more focused on fixing the "
"real issues,  you are welcome to <link url='http://techbase.kde.org/"
"Contribute/Bugsquad'>join the BugSquad team</link>."
msgstr ""

